      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "922. 求下列各式的值：",
        "1) $2\\frac{1}{3}:2\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot1\\frac{3}{5}$；　　2) $2\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot\\frac{12}{13}:3\\frac{3}{8}$；",
        "3) $1\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot2\\frac{1}{5}:7\\frac{1}{3}$；　　4) $3\\frac{2}{3}:7\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{5}$."
      ]
    },
